    "text": "By FOX 11 Digital Team ,\n9 hours ago\nLOS ANGELES - Jose Zayas, the man accused of fatally shooting Bruce Rodriguez, a father of two and Culver City bus driver, pleaded not guilty on Thursday. On Thursday, Oct. 1 around 5:15 p.m., authorities responded to reports of gunfire and an injured bus driver near the intersection of Centinela Avenue and Washington Boulevard in Mar Vista.\nRead full article\nAdd to Preferred Sources",
